  "ownership": [
    "Existing public channel_spectrum/calibrated_spectrum own true retained-sample PSD, electrical calibration/integration and amplifier-only gain. The current sample budget maps through accepted spectrum_average_capacity; actual stage continuity stays backend-owned.",
    "Existing public amplifier_bins supplies post-gain I/Q; Qt preserves the prior before-amplifier and sampled after-amplifier scatter scaling policies without computing gain.",
    "Existing public physical_bins supplies actual raw FFT I/Q/power and original coordinates. The presentation renderer groups finite/absent backend values without computing logarithmic power or PSD.",
    "Existing public response supplies configured H or actual retained H-hat and all response/impulse diagnostics; public layout supplies original frequencies/PLC endpoints. Missing estimates remain unavailable; the exact remaining slicer/FEC tail is frozen."
  ],
